  /**
   * Recursively converts all logical type fields within the given Avro record to their corresponding Java types.
   * Nested structures (arrays, maps and records) are traversed so that logical types at any depth in the schema are
   * resolved. For example, UUID logical types become {@link java.util.UUID}, timestamp-millis become
   * {@link java.time.Instant} and decimal become {@link java.math.BigDecimal}.
   *
   * <p>Fields that do not carry a logical type and are not part of an array, map or record are passed through
